/2117938089033400832"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-04T11:01:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117935341776892274"], "id": "2117935341776892274", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 68, "impression_count": 84024, "like_count": 1248, "quote_count": 15, "reply_count": 68, "retweet_count": 71}, "text": "The whole theory that to expand the map that Dems had to nominate working classoids who dress in Carhartts just seems totally obliterated.", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2117935341776892274"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:47:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117931819383357736"], "id": "2117931819383357736", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 22, "impression_count": 93579, "like_count": 400, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 38, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Are there any interesting races that haven't been called yet beyond Mississippi?", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2117931819383357736"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:44:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117931022683672996"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "SPCX"}]}, "id": "2117931022683672996", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 14683, "like_count": 43, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$SPCX -4.4% pre market. Off its lows.", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2117931022683672996"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:38:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117929492060790987"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/k8011wJjIY", "end": 144, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2117929492060790987/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117929433235435520", "start": 121, "url": "https://t.co/k8011wJjIY"}]}, "id": "2117929492060790987", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 31286, "like_count": 379, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 37, "retweet_count": 27}, "text": "Huge overnight market rebound. NASDAQ-100% futures up close to 1% after having plunged over 2% after the initial results https://t.co/k8011wJjIY", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2117929492060790987"}, {"author_id": "917683048782503937", "created_at": "2026-11-04T07:06:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117876221383979066"], "id": "2117876221383979066", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 25, "impression_count": 13202, "like_count": 136, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 35}, "text": "1/2\nCaixin: \"Chinese shipyards now hold about 68% of the global orderbook, and 81.8% of global new orders, up 14.5 percentage points from a year earlier. The country’s yards are expected to deliver about 60% of the world’s new ships in 2026, while capacity could rise to a new", "url": "https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2117876221383979066"}, {"author_id": "917683048782503937", "created_at": "2026-11-04T06:45:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117870751021682828"], "id": "2117870751021682828", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 9108, "like_count": 72, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "Yicai: \"The sales profit margin in China's automotive industry has continued sliding this year, coming in at just 3.3% for the first three quarters of this year, with September sales profit margin coming in at just 1.4%, the lowest monthly level ever recorded.\"", "url": "https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2117870751021682828"}, {"author_id": "961132338", "created_at": "2026-11-04T06:43:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117870368367210603"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/sfchronicle/st…", "end": 39, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/sfchronicle/status/2117869478063087849", "start": 16, "url": "https://t.co/exoY1pqHBm"}]}, "id": "2117870368367210603", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2484, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}